t had been replaced with some type of greens. They were delicious just wish i had been told of the swap was looking forward to the squash, other than that the food was amazing and the service was great. One little trick, the address Leeds's you to a building on Agriculture street with a cheesecake food truck nextt to it, thi..."},{"business_id":"b2NYyx-BqwNHgOC5RnXzmw","review_id":"2UevsAB4WuyXFXzi5dnyUw","date":"2020-03-16T20:25:11","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9181943535804749,"text_excerpt":"I first saw Original Thought on Instagram and the vegan/veggie friendly food looked good so decided to check them out. after eating the food and talking with the owner, this is now one of my favorite places to eat in the city. the better than popeyes sandwich and the wings were excellent. the macaroni bowl was alright but overall the food is good, tasty, and decently priced"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"b2NYyx-BqwNHgOC5RnXzmw","photo_id":"qMit6xY6oGWlYgiADrmiHw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/qMit6xY6oGWlYgiADrmiHw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9084790945053101},{"business_id":"b2NYyx-BqwNHgOC5RnXzmw","photo_id":"RfuVATzIeu8h47yQJfoh1w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/RfuVATzIeu8h47yQJfoh1w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8985404968261719},{"business_id":"b2NYyx-BqwNHgOC5RnXzmw","photo_id":"t4A7GQhMO7qYtI_z6xkJ8g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/t4A7GQhMO7qYtI_z6xkJ8g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8781301975250244},{"business_id":"b2NYyx-BqwNHgOC5RnXzmw","photo_id":"u5e7GJ3apwskU1q3OI4wxQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/u5e7GJ3apwskU1q3OI4wxQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8707230091094971}]},"notebook_case":null}
